# Periodic spheroid mobility + Mari gap regularization + sliding/rolling contact
plugin load ${slurry_plugin}
units si
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style ellipsoid
atom_modify map array
read_data particles.data
comm_modify vel yes
pair_style zero 3.9999999999999998e-06
pair_coeff * *
neighbor 7.9999999999999996e-07 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
timestep 2.5000000000000002e-06
fix shear all deform 0 xz erate 100 remap v units box
fix hydro all slurry/bridge 0.01 100 7.9999999999999996e-06 0.001 0.3 contact 10 0.24 rolling 10 0.24 shape spheroid mobility_backend mesh spectral 2 spectral_tolerance 1e-08 tolerance 9.9999999999999995e-07 iterations 1000 history history.csv 1 5
compute shape all property/atom shapex shapey shapez quatw quati quatj quatk angmomx angmomy angmomz
dump trajectory all custom 100 trajectory.lammpstrj id type x y z vx vy vz c_shape[*] f_hydro[*]
dump_modify trajectory sort id format float %.17g
thermo 1
thermo_style custom step time atoms f_hydro[1] f_hydro[2] f_hydro[3] f_hydro[4]
thermo_modify flush yes lost error
run 8
write_data final.data nocoeff
